# ---- licensed third-party content: NEVER commit ----------------------------
# Assetsville is a paid Fab entitlement (680 MB). Anyone joining adds it to
# their own project from their own account.
Content/AssetsvilleTown/

# ---- engine-regenerable -----------------------------------------------------
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Binaries/
Build/
.vs/
*.pdb

# ---- per-machine editor state -----------------------------------------------
# Console history, crash-reporter sessions, editor prefs, world state. Tracked
# by accident before Saved/ patterns were tightened; untracked 2026-08-25.
Saved/Config/

# ---- agent infrastructure ---------------------------------------------------
# Git worktrees that background agents work in. Never content.
.claude/worktrees/

# ---- capture churn ----------------------------------------------------------
# 2.5 GB of raw 20 MB HighResShot output. Curated evidence lives in Docs/evidence.
Saved/Screenshots/
Saved/Autosaves/
Saved/ShaderDebugInfo/
Saved/Logs/
Saved/Crashes/
Saved/SourceControl/

# ---- full-resolution evidence PNGs ------------------------------------------
# The records reference these; the downsampled set in Docs/evidence carries the
# same information at 1/100th the size.
# recursive - a views/ subfolder slipped past a single-level pattern
Saved/**/*.png
Saved/**/*.jpg
!Docs/evidence/*.jpg
Saved/Stage1/obj_w/
Saved/Stage2/data/*.json

# ---- local scratch ----------------------------------------------------------
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.mcp_sid
_guarded_tmp.py

# Deko Matrix City is a 5.7 GB donor pack, same class as Assetsville: source
# material, not authored result. Anyone joining adds it from their own account.
Content/Deko_MatrixDemo/

# Lane 4 diagnostics. MATERIAL_RECORD.md is the reasoning and IS committed; the
# captures beside it are automated A/B diagnostics by its own admission, and
# curated evidence belongs in Docs/evidence.
Saved/Lane4/*.jpg
Saved/Lane4/*.png
Saved/Lane4/*.html
Saved/Lane4/backup/

# Mega Street Props is a donor pack, same class as Assetsville and Deko:
# source material, not authored result. It was swept into a commit by a
# `git add -A` that I ran without checking what was untracked first - 2.7 GB of
# LFS objects. The rule that should have caught it is the one already written
# above: donor packs are never committed.
Content/Mega_Street_Props_Pack/

# OS metadata
.DS_Store

# Uniblocks is a donor pack, same class as Assetsville, Deko and Mega Street
# Props: source material, not authored result. Swept into a commit by the
# coordinator's own `git add -A` catch-all on 2026-08-27 - the third
# occurrence of exactly this mistake, each time by a different hand. The rule
# below now exists in tooling form too: NEVER commit with add -A; enumerate.
Content/Uniblocks/

# Lens rig session state: which mode the editor is currently in. Runtime
# state like .mcp_sid, not source - a fresh checkout has no mode until
# lensrig runs, and captures correctly stamp "unknown" until it does.
Tools/measure/lens_mode.json
